    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "story_text",
      "label": "Story content",
      "default": "<p>Treasures by Tiara was born from a simple belief: fine-looking designer pieces shouldn’t feel out of reach or sit locked away waiting for a rare occasion.</p><p>From sculpted necklaces, earrings, rings, bracelets, and cufflinks to signature corsets and evening gloves, every creation blends heirloom romance with modern self-expression, thoughtfully priced so you can treasure yourself freely.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "story_image",
      "label": "Story editorial image (optional)"
